stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> DISCONNECTED
  DISCONNECTED --> CONNECTED: connect() / TCP mở
  CONNECTED --> KEY_EXCHANGED: HELLO_ACK + KEY_EXCHANGE
  CONNECTED --> DISCONNECTED: timeout / lỗi giao thức
  KEY_EXCHANGED --> AUTHENTICATED: AUTH_OK
  KEY_EXCHANGED --> KEY_EXCHANGED: AUTH_FAIL (thử lại)
  AUTHENTICATED --> DISCONNECTED: LOGOUT / TCP đóng / heartbeat timeout
